  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "How many of you are tired of seeing celebrities adopting kids from the African continent?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC8E66E7D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "Well, it's not all that bad.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F9C2611F4D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "I was adopted.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B4D1EE9B4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "I grew up in rural Uganda, lost both my parents when I was very, very young.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5749A71DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 50,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "negative effects of poverty",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6CAAC557C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 125,
        "endOffset": 136,
        "text": "you name it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CADD4DDD9D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "But my life changed when I got accepted into an orphanage.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BC64418DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "Through one of those sponsor-an-orphan programs, I was sponsored and given an opportunity to acquire an education.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E533792C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "I started off in Uganda.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5352BB646D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 204,
        "text": "I went through school, and the way this particular program worked, you finished high school and after high school, you go learn a trade -- to become a carpenter, a mechanic or something along those lines.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34FE196875",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "My case was a little different.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EAA1A5046F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 189,
        "text": "The sponsor family that was sending these 25 dollars a month to this orphanage to sponsor me, which -- I had never met them -- said, \"Well ... we would like to send you to college instead.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3D5DFC232B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 21,
        "text": "Oh -- it gets better.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "515982E399",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "382E13DBC5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 67,
        "text": "And they said, \"If you get the paperwork, we'll send you to school in America instead.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A18B107179",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "So with their help, I went to the embassy and applied for the visa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AC2A7E716C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 0,
        "text": "I got the visa.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7104111410",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "like it was yesterday",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "58AE47C85A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 65,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "a hop in my step, smile on my face",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4FBE6CDC32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "I went home that night, and I slept with my passport, because I was afraid that someone might steal it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FBB4EE58CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E89589E326",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "I kept feeling it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F4125D6C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "I had a good idea for security.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E3CA59B81",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "I was like, \"OK, I'm going to put it in a plastic bag, and take it outside and dig a hole, and put it in there.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "834597189C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "I did that, went back in the house.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "04C59D89B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "I could not fall asleep.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C0DCA9179",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "I was like, \"Maybe someone saw me.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA2435E7A5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 110,
        "endOffset": 130,
        "text": "anxiety-filled night",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0B32E7243A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
